"f": "Satisfaction 91% and regret 2%. Narrowing of the vagina (stenosis) 11%, fistula (an abnormal opening, for example into the bowel) 1%, tissue loss 4%, prolapse 3%. Average depth 9.4 cm with penile inversion and 15.3 cm with bowel techniques.",
