"pop": "39 studies of 1,731 people having phalloplasty, mostly with a forearm flap.",
"f": "Complications were common (76.5% had at least one), mostly of the urethra (the tube that carries urine): fistula 34% and narrowing (stricture) 25%. Most could feel touch (94%) and pass urine standing (92%).",
