"pop": "2,679 people with a gender incongruence diagnosis in the Swedish total population register.",
"f": "The first analysis linked more time since surgery with less mental health treatment. After statistical review, the journal published a correction (Am J Psychiatry 2020;177(8):734; doi 10.1176/appi.ajp.2020.1778correction): compared with people who had not had surgery, there was no advantage of surgery for later mood or anxiety care, prescriptions or hospital stays after suicide attempts.",
